    "# [5.0.0-beta.0](https://github.com/algolia/react-instantsearch/compare/v4.4.2...v5.0.0-beta.0) (2018-01-30)\r",
    "\r",
    "This new version introduce a complete revamp of the naming and the HTML output of most widgets. The goal of this release is to provide improved semantics to our users.\r",
    "\r",
    "This release also introduces a new CSS naming convention which will be reused across all InstantSearch libraries. This will enable the possibility to develop cross-libraries CSS themes easily.\r",
    "\r",
    "You can find all the informations for the migration [in our documentation](https://react-instantsearch-beta.netlify.com/react-instantsearch/guide/migration_guide_v5).\r",
